    rdfs:comment "The property that this Column is mapped to. A column is mapped to one property. It is an annotation property because its values are properties, which are not individuals."@en .


###  https://ekgf.org/ontology/raw#valueOf
:valueOf
    rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty ;
    rdfs:domain :Value ;
    rdfs:range :Row ;
    <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/creator> <http://orcid.org/0000-0003-2309-5068> ;
